sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    box rgb(255, 250, 230) RemotediagProxy (EP Container)
        participant Drain as CallbackDrainThread
        participant CLI as ProxyIpcClient
        participant USC as UnixSocketClient (ReaderThread)
    end
    box rgb(230, 245, 255) RemoteDiag (IP Container)
        participant USS as UnixSocketServer (ReaderThread)
        participant SRV as ProxyIpcServer
    end

    Note over USC,USS: 1. Phat hien mat ket noi (Connection Lost)
    alt Loi khi nhan du lieu (Read Path)
        USC->>USC: recvAll() that bai (EOF / ECONNRESET)
        USC->>USC: closeSocket() (shutdown + close fd, socketFd = -1)
    else Loi khi gui du lieu (Write Path)
        CLI->>USC: sendFrame() -> sendAll() that bai
        USC->>USC: shutdown(socketFd) lam gian doan recvAll()
        USC->>USC: closeSocket()
    end

    par Server xu ly ngat ket noi
        USS->>USS: recvAll() that bai -> closeClientSocket() (clientFd = -1)
        loop Vong lap cho Client ket noi lai (Server Reader Loop)
            USS->>USS: select(serverFd + 1, timeout=500ms)
        end
    and Client thuc hien Auto-Reconnect (Exponential Backoff)
        loop Thu ket noi lai cho toi khi thanh cong
            USC->>USS: connectToServer() -> connect(socketPath)
            alt Ket noi that bai
                USC->>USC: sleep(backoffMs) -> backoffMs = min(backoffMs * 2, 5000ms)
            else Ket noi thanh cong
                USS-->>USC: accept() thanh cong -> clientFd moi
                USS->>USS: applySendTimeout(5s) & notify_all()
                USC->>USC: socketFd = sock moi
                USC->>USC: applySendTimeout(5s) & notify_all()
                USC->>USC: Reset backoffMs = 100ms
            end
        end
    end

    Note over CLI,Drain: 2. Xu ly Callback trong luc mat ket noi
    Note over CLI: Callback duoc luu vao mPendingCallbacks (toi da 64)
    loop Moi 100ms
        Drain->>CLI: flushCallbacks()
        CLI->>USC: Kiem tra isConnected()
        alt Chua ket noi
            CLI-->>Drain: Bo qua, giu nguyen callback trong queue
        else Da ket noi lai thanh cong
            CLI->>USC: sendFrame(Frame)
            USC->>USS: sendAll() toi server
            CLI->>CLI: pop callback ra khoi queue
        end
    end
